Apply this domain algorithm to prepared evidence: Interpret sketches, descriptions, and intended use to distinguish functional requirements from aesthetic preferences and unstated assumptions. Identify consequential missing dimensions or loads and request clarification rather than inventing specifications that determine manufacturability or safety.
For each field, return a value only when supported, source IDs, authority, one rejected alternative, and status established, disputed, unknown, or inapplicable. Preserve contrary evidence and distinguish observation from inference.
